DESCRIPTION:The island capital's own feast\, on Annunciation day: liturgy and procession at Evangelistria in Pigadia\, then a town-wide glendi. Olympos marks the same day. A good reason to be on Karpathos out of season\, and the ferries run.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/karpathos/#pigadia-panigiri-of-panagia-evangelistria-pigadia
